# Account & Data Deletion Request

**App Name:** HT Helper  
**Developer:** Carlos Torres V

At **HT Helper**, we respect your privacy and give you full control over your personal data. This page provides clear instructions on how you can request the permanent deletion of your account and associated data.

---

## How to Request Account Deletion

You can request account deletion through either of the following methods:

### Option 1: Web / Email Request (No App Access Required)
If you no longer have the app installed or cannot log in, you can request manual deletion:

1. Send an email to **[ehtappscnslab@gmail.com](mailto:ehtappscnslab@gmail.com)** with the subject: `Account Deletion Request - HT Helper`.
2. Include the following details to help us verify ownership:
   * Your full name
   * The registered email address or account ID associated with the app
3. Our team will verify your request and process the deletion within **30 days**. You will receive a confirmation email once complete.

---

## Types of Data Deleted

When your account deletion request is completed, the following data is permanently removed from our active databases:

* **Account Credentials:** Username, password hash, and authentication tokens.
* **Profile Data:** Full name, contact email address, profile preferences, and user settings.
* **App Usage & Progress:** Stored educational progress, completed modules, user history, and personal activity logs.

---

## Data Retained & Retention Period

In compliance with legal, regulatory, and security obligations, certain limited data may be retained after account deletion:

* **Financial & Transaction Records:** In-app purchase history or payment receipts will be retained for up to **7 years** as required by applicable tax and accounting laws.
* **Anonymized Aggregated Data:** Non-personally identifiable usage statistics may be retained indefinitely for quality control and system performance analysis (this data cannot be linked back to individual users).
* **Security & Fraud Prevention Logs:** Security logs containing IP addresses or authentication attempts may be held for up to **90 days** before being automatically purged.

---

## Contact & Privacy Enquiries

If you have any questions regarding our account deletion policy or data retention practices, please reach out to us at **[ehtappscnslab@gmail.com](mailto:ehtappscnslab@gmail.com)**.
